I will discuss the lore and explain a few
minor details of the plot that happen early

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.809
on.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:13.599
If you want to know the meaning of this spiral
on the tree, then stick around to the end

00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:14.599
of this video.

